  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Meeting notes to tasks\nTurns a transcript into tasks, loops over each one, creates a Notion page when it has an owner, and asks you when it does not.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Tasks without an owner are never assigned by guess. They are sent back to you.\n\nA failed run alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
    "height": 220,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "meeting-notes-to-tasks-note",
   "name": "Read me",
